WEBVTT

00:02.035 --> 00:04.365
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.465 --> 00:07.525
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.005 --> 00:10.735
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.735 --> 00:15.405
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.815 --> 00:22.805
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.525 --> 00:27.385
Dragon Drive

00:27.385 --> 00:32.915
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.025 --> 00:35.995
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.995 --> 00:39.265
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.735 --> 00:44.105
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.105 --> 00:46.075
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.075 --> 00:52.415
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.115 --> 00:56.485
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.485 --> 00:59.715
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.025 --> 01:05.025
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.025 --> 01:06.615
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.725 --> 01:09.135
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.135 --> 01:12.295
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.665 --> 01:17.745
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.745 --> 01:20.475
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.475 --> 01:28.175
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.325 --> 01:42.625
My name is Sayaka Towa.

01:45.565 --> 01:47.895
Go! Airblast!

01:57.115 --> 01:59.415
I won't lose, no matter what!

02:08.655 --> 02:11.825
Rikyu, the Other Earth

02:28.515 --> 02:30.535
Wh-Where am I?

02:31.115 --> 02:32.475
Chibi!

02:35.115 --> 02:37.175
I wonder what this sound is.

03:14.895 --> 03:16.655
Huh? It was only a dream?

03:16.855 --> 03:20.125
Idiot! Idiot!

03:20.125 --> 03:21.435
Idiot!

03:21.435 --> 03:24.135
Hey! How dare you make fun of me?!

03:24.135 --> 03:25.865
Idiot!

03:26.905 --> 03:29.705
More importantly,
that darned Hikaru Himuro...

03:29.705 --> 03:32.365
Super Champion:
Mr. Hikaru Himuro

03:35.475 --> 03:36.945
Sea Palace

03:39.385 --> 03:40.005
Hello!

03:42.185 --> 03:43.245
Hurry up! Hurry up!

03:44.985 --> 03:46.855
All right, here we go!

03:47.755 --> 03:49.455
You want to train on your own?

03:49.455 --> 03:50.255
Yes.

03:50.255 --> 03:52.485
Why, all of a sudden?

03:53.665 --> 03:57.065
I've always been a klutz at anything I do.

03:57.295 --> 04:00.435
And whenever I try to look cool,
it's always kind of half-hearted.

04:00.435 --> 04:02.665
They even called me "Half-Hearted Man".

04:03.275 --> 04:05.905
But there's one thing I don't want to lose at.

04:05.905 --> 04:07.435
Is that Dragon Drive?

04:07.605 --> 04:08.595
Yes.

04:08.945 --> 04:11.115
There's one guy I want to beat.

04:11.115 --> 04:12.445
No matter what.

04:12.815 --> 04:15.845
This guy looks like he's
become one with the dragon.

04:16.785 --> 04:18.685
The one he wants to beat...

04:19.155 --> 04:20.915
Could it be Hikaru Himuro?

04:21.595 --> 04:23.455
He has inspired this boy.

04:24.425 --> 04:27.085
I was right to make them fight one another.

04:27.725 --> 04:31.325
I feel that I can become one with Chibi
if I train hard enough.

04:31.565 --> 04:34.405
I wanna catch up to him as quickly as I can.

04:35.375 --> 04:36.395
All right.

04:38.975 --> 04:40.035
Where are we going?

04:40.245 --> 04:42.015
The special training room.

04:42.015 --> 04:43.175
Special?

04:43.175 --> 04:45.285
For special members only.

04:45.285 --> 04:47.585
Since when am I a special member?

04:47.585 --> 04:48.815
Since today.

04:48.815 --> 04:50.715
That's where Himuro trained as well.

04:51.355 --> 04:52.215
He did?

04:58.395 --> 04:59.755
Kyoji Tachibana.

05:00.165 --> 05:01.285
Sayaka Towa.

05:01.665 --> 05:02.795
Those two!

05:02.795 --> 05:05.435
Only specially selected players
can become special members.

05:05.435 --> 05:07.865
Kyoji and Sayaka are special members, too.

05:08.435 --> 05:09.505
Specially selected?

05:09.505 --> 05:10.695
If you don't work hard...

05:10.835 --> 05:14.535
...you won't be able to catch up to those two,
never mind Hikaru Himuro.

05:18.645 --> 05:20.045
I'm starting to get revved up!

05:20.645 --> 05:22.055
Let's do it, Chibi.

05:22.055 --> 05:23.955
Let's train and become better than them!

05:47.975 --> 05:50.535
Come on, Chibi, won't you please fight?

05:50.745 --> 05:53.275
We can't get stronger by running away.

05:55.185 --> 05:57.555
Wh-What the?!

05:57.555 --> 05:59.525
Hey, Chibi! Help me!

06:02.495 --> 06:06.255
I'm gonna be eaten alive!

06:24.415 --> 06:26.215
Are you all right, Reiji?

06:26.415 --> 06:29.855
What a surprise to see you here.

06:30.215 --> 06:32.775
Sayaka Towa.

06:33.325 --> 06:35.425
I'm here to do some training as well.

06:35.425 --> 06:36.655
I want to get stronger.

06:36.655 --> 06:39.995
My, your determination
and ambition are wonderful.

06:40.165 --> 06:42.135
That's a nice attitude.

06:42.335 --> 06:43.385
I like that.

06:43.835 --> 06:46.465
How would you like to be my sparring mate?

06:46.465 --> 06:47.065
What?

06:47.065 --> 06:51.135
If you become my partner, you will
certainly be able to improve your skills.

06:51.235 --> 06:52.365
Uh, well...

06:52.845 --> 06:55.365
I don't want anyone's help with my training.

06:55.615 --> 06:56.905
Sorry, but I'll do it on my own.

06:57.515 --> 06:58.875
That's fine, then.

06:59.085 --> 07:00.775
You seem quite firm about it.

07:01.655 --> 07:03.645
Please do move up to my level soon.

07:03.985 --> 07:07.015
Then we can go and hunt dragons together.

07:07.325 --> 07:09.055
It'll be so much fun.

07:09.055 --> 07:10.115
Uh, sure.

07:12.865 --> 07:14.885
Well, good luck with your training.

07:17.995 --> 07:21.625
Isn't it humiliating, having her save you
while you're in the middle of training?

07:21.735 --> 07:22.725
Huh?

07:26.645 --> 07:27.735
Kyoji!

07:28.045 --> 07:31.135
But like she said,
that's a very good attitude.

07:31.585 --> 07:33.815
Your goal is to beat Hikaru Himuro, right?

07:34.115 --> 07:34.945
I guess.

07:35.455 --> 07:36.615
Same here.

07:37.055 --> 07:40.385
It's as if I've finally found something
really interesting to go after.

07:40.955 --> 07:43.595
But you were the one
who got my fire going in the first place.

07:43.595 --> 07:44.495
Me?

07:44.495 --> 07:46.325
Or rather, Chibi.

07:46.895 --> 07:50.165
I said that other day
that you were hard to read...

07:50.595 --> 07:52.435
But Chibi's the one that's hard to read.

07:53.235 --> 07:54.965
It's as though he holds some secret.

07:55.235 --> 07:56.535
Like he's a hidden character.

07:57.905 --> 07:59.395
You think so, too?

07:59.545 --> 08:01.375
Actually, he's got some special powers.

08:01.375 --> 08:04.245
It's not so much the power,
but the ability to win using only luck.

08:04.445 --> 08:05.875
The ability to bring good luck.

08:06.245 --> 08:08.685
That's the kind of ability Chibi has.

08:08.885 --> 08:10.855
It basically means that you're lucky.

08:11.055 --> 08:12.075
What?!

08:12.185 --> 08:15.385
But if you want to get stronger for real
and not just rely on your luck...

08:15.725 --> 08:18.155
...try the field beyond those hills.

08:18.265 --> 08:21.385
There are some dragons there
that are suited to your level.

08:23.135 --> 08:24.595
Good luck with it.

08:24.595 --> 08:25.465
See ya.

08:25.465 --> 08:26.705
What the?

08:26.705 --> 08:27.865
Is he making fun of me?

08:28.735 --> 08:30.475
Reiji Ozora...

08:30.475 --> 08:33.335
...I look forward to your development.

08:35.945 --> 08:38.075
You just watch, Kyoji Tachibana!

08:38.075 --> 08:39.915
I'm gonna become much stronger!

08:41.615 --> 08:44.085
Way to go, Chibi! Go! Go!

08:44.385 --> 08:46.985
Get him now! Go for it!

08:47.225 --> 08:50.025
You're doing good! Chibisuke!

08:50.555 --> 08:53.365
You must first observe your opponent...

08:53.365 --> 08:55.425
...and learn its weakness.

08:56.865 --> 09:00.925
Once you figure out its weakness,
you research how you can best attack it.

09:01.265 --> 09:02.405
That's it, Chibi!

09:02.405 --> 09:03.495
The belly button!

09:03.535 --> 09:06.095
Go after his belly button! Go!

09:12.985 --> 09:16.645
And if you want to become stronger,
you must battle all sorts of opponents.

09:17.385 --> 09:20.585
That's so that you can deal with any kind
of opponent you're faced with.

09:21.285 --> 09:22.355
I understand now.

09:22.355 --> 09:23.585
Thanks for the tip!

09:24.655 --> 09:25.645
Hey!

09:27.525 --> 09:29.585
You did really well, Chibi!

09:32.905 --> 09:34.195
That tickles!

09:39.405 --> 09:42.065
Reiji Ozora, are you awake yet?!

09:48.685 --> 09:49.815
Reiji!

09:49.815 --> 09:51.285
I said, Reiji!

09:51.455 --> 09:54.215
Hang on a minute!

09:55.295 --> 09:57.655
Hey, what have you been up to lately?

09:57.995 --> 09:59.625
Are you avoiding me or something?

09:59.925 --> 10:02.435
You've been sneaking around
behind my back, and...

10:02.435 --> 10:05.125
- Sorry, but I'm in a rush.
- Wha?

10:05.835 --> 10:07.935
What's with that attitude?!

10:07.935 --> 10:09.305
I can't believe it!

10:09.305 --> 10:11.435
There's definitely something going on here.

10:13.275 --> 10:13.935
Okay...

10:16.445 --> 10:18.845
Daisuke!

10:19.845 --> 10:20.975
Maiko Yukino?

10:22.455 --> 10:24.215
I've been waiting for you, Daisuke!

10:24.215 --> 10:25.055
What?

10:25.055 --> 10:26.715
You were waiting for me?

10:27.055 --> 10:28.985
- Now, come on.
- Uh, what?

10:29.155 --> 10:30.985
Come on, hurry up!

10:31.155 --> 10:34.255
Wh-What do you want me to hurry with?

10:36.895 --> 10:38.195
What? Reiji is?

10:38.195 --> 10:39.305
That's right.

10:39.305 --> 10:41.395
He's up to something behind my back.

10:42.405 --> 10:45.405
B-But why don't you forget about him
and let him do what he wants?

10:45.405 --> 10:47.205
Because I can't!

10:47.805 --> 10:52.105
What if... What if he's going out on a date
with Sayaka Towa or something?

10:52.445 --> 10:54.005
That might be good.

10:54.385 --> 10:56.785
If all goes well...

10:56.955 --> 10:58.715
Sea Palace

11:01.285 --> 11:02.825
I'm sure he came here.

11:02.825 --> 11:05.585
And with that girl to boot!

11:07.825 --> 11:11.785
Yeah, but maybe there's really
nothing you can do about it.

11:25.045 --> 11:28.015
That elevator's so slow!

11:28.885 --> 11:30.555
Let's split up and look for him.

11:30.555 --> 11:31.745
What? Me, too?

11:32.125 --> 11:33.625
Of course!

11:33.625 --> 11:35.645
You go that way, Daisuke!

11:38.395 --> 11:39.765
My sweet honey!

11:39.765 --> 11:42.125
I think you should forget about him!

11:42.595 --> 11:43.685
That Reiji!

11:43.865 --> 11:45.595
I'm going to find him even if it kills me!

11:49.275 --> 11:50.495
There he is!

11:52.145 --> 11:53.975
I knew Reiji was here!

11:54.745 --> 11:55.615
Hi.

11:55.615 --> 11:56.595
What's up?

11:56.715 --> 11:58.675
Uh, Kyoji...

11:59.145 --> 12:01.385
Well, you seem to be in a bit of a rush.

12:01.385 --> 12:02.715
Are you looking for someone?

12:02.855 --> 12:04.685
Uh, well, not really!

12:04.685 --> 12:07.555
Could you be looking for Reiji?

12:07.555 --> 12:08.795
Have you seen him?

12:08.795 --> 12:11.155
I think he's over that way.

12:11.595 --> 12:12.565
That way?

12:12.565 --> 12:16.795
Reiji's really been getting into it,
enjoying it every day...

12:16.865 --> 12:18.165
...with Miss L.

12:18.165 --> 12:20.495
It's enough to make me jealous.

12:20.605 --> 12:22.005
With Miss L?!

12:22.075 --> 12:23.905
Every day?!

12:23.905 --> 12:25.995
Enjoying it?

12:27.505 --> 12:29.975
Oh, tickle, tickle, tickle, tickle...

12:30.075 --> 12:32.785
You mean that stupid idiot Reiji is?!

12:32.785 --> 12:34.945
I'm going to smack some sense into him!

12:41.585 --> 12:42.785
What the?!

12:43.125 --> 12:45.525
He's not going to get away with this!

12:45.525 --> 12:46.425
Ow, ow!

12:46.425 --> 12:47.725
You're digging your nails into me!

12:49.365 --> 12:50.125
We're going in!

12:50.435 --> 12:53.035
Ah, this must be what they call
the agony of love...

12:53.035 --> 12:54.895
I'm not going to be responsible for this.

12:58.545 --> 13:00.075
Miss L isn't around.

13:00.075 --> 13:01.095
There!

13:05.145 --> 13:06.745
What is this room?

13:06.745 --> 13:07.545
Beats me.

13:07.545 --> 13:09.885
I had no idea there was such a room.

13:13.125 --> 13:14.115
What are you going to do?

13:14.485 --> 13:15.555
I'm going.

13:15.555 --> 13:17.495
To the D-Z one, where Reiji is.

13:17.495 --> 13:20.765
Who knows what Reiji is doing
out there in the D-Z one?

13:20.765 --> 13:22.065
- But... But...
- Let's go!

13:22.065 --> 13:23.055
Okay!

13:27.305 --> 13:30.735
This all seems so different from usual.
It feels kind of weird.

13:31.275 --> 13:33.905
Is this really a D-Z one stage?

13:35.575 --> 13:38.635
We haven't run into
a single dragon so far.

13:39.815 --> 13:43.345
- What's the matter?
- Kanper's been kind of tense for the last bit.

13:43.685 --> 13:45.885
There could be a dragon nearby.

13:45.925 --> 13:48.855
Could that be little Chibi and Reiji?

13:49.255 --> 13:50.725
I doubt it.

13:51.025 --> 13:54.585
I mean, little Chibi's not at a level
where he'd make Kanper nervous, after all.

13:57.435 --> 13:58.605
What is this?

13:58.605 --> 14:00.095
What's with the bubbles?

14:00.665 --> 14:02.395
Where did they come from?

14:03.475 --> 14:05.135
What's going on here?

14:09.645 --> 14:10.635
How pretty.

14:13.115 --> 14:14.845
What are you doing, Gholaoh?

14:18.585 --> 14:20.885
These bubbles are starting to creep me out!

14:24.795 --> 14:25.915
Kanper...

14:31.965 --> 14:32.895
What the?!

14:33.635 --> 14:35.625
I've never seen anything like it!

14:40.305 --> 14:42.575
This is my chance to show that I'm a man!

14:42.575 --> 14:44.015
Daisuke!

14:46.615 --> 14:49.135
M-My body can't move...

14:50.785 --> 14:53.915
Could these bubbles be some kind of glue
for catching prey?

14:55.225 --> 14:56.485
There's another one!

14:59.665 --> 15:01.185
Roar, Gholaoh!

15:06.005 --> 15:08.165
Oh, no! It won't hold up!

15:16.315 --> 15:17.935
It's too strong!

15:18.885 --> 15:20.675
They're a whole different level.

15:20.885 --> 15:24.375
With powerful dragons like these,
by now Reiji must be...

15:36.295 --> 15:37.285
Reiji?

15:41.035 --> 15:42.305
Did you say Reiji?!

15:42.305 --> 15:43.235
It's true!

15:43.235 --> 15:44.835
Reiji's the one controlling that dragon!

15:45.175 --> 15:46.575
You've gotta be kidding.

15:48.815 --> 15:49.745
Hey!

15:49.745 --> 15:51.835
Good job figuring out where I was!

15:52.215 --> 15:53.405
Reiji...

15:54.045 --> 15:55.705
Did you ask Miss L?

15:55.815 --> 15:57.975
How can you be so calm about this?

15:58.215 --> 16:00.915
Sneaking around like that,
without even saying a word to me!

16:02.325 --> 16:03.795
Reiji! Behind you! Watch out!

16:08.295 --> 16:10.325
Wh-Why aren't you getting out of the way?!

16:10.895 --> 16:12.765
I can't see because of the smoke!

16:29.755 --> 16:31.685
- I-It disappeared?!
- No! He's behind it!

16:32.925 --> 16:35.085
Beat it!

16:43.765 --> 16:44.695
All right!

16:49.335 --> 16:50.735
It's gone.

16:54.105 --> 16:57.235
Is that guy really Reiji?

16:57.775 --> 16:59.375
Way to go, Chibi.

17:06.955 --> 17:08.855
We've finally found him.

17:09.225 --> 17:10.455
Elder...

17:13.825 --> 17:14.885
Meguru...

17:17.895 --> 17:21.065
Wow, so that huge dragon
was actually little Chibi?

17:25.445 --> 17:26.935
Yeah!

17:27.305 --> 17:28.915
Amazing!

17:28.915 --> 17:29.895
Yeah...

17:30.645 --> 17:32.135
I'm so impressed, Chibi!

17:33.045 --> 17:34.375
Hey, hang on.

17:34.485 --> 17:35.975
I think I did pretty good, too!

17:36.615 --> 17:38.775
It was Chibi who did all that.

17:39.085 --> 17:41.785
It was all because of you, right, Chibi?

17:41.855 --> 17:44.015
That's right. It wasn't you.

17:45.495 --> 17:48.325
But I was the one
who drew out Chibi's power!

17:48.695 --> 17:51.295
It was my passion and hard work that...

17:51.465 --> 17:53.295
Give me a break. Right, Chibi?

17:56.635 --> 17:58.695
I'm so envious.

18:01.005 --> 18:03.845
There's no doubt.
Chibi has amazing innate powers.

18:04.475 --> 18:07.275
But it was Reiji Ozora
who drew out that power.

18:08.515 --> 18:14.285
To find players who can bring out
one hundred percent of a dragon's power.

18:14.485 --> 18:16.085
That's the true purpose of this game.

18:16.525 --> 18:19.395
So I want you all to develop even more.

18:19.825 --> 18:23.895
Hikaru Himuro,
and the champions of the other blocks.

18:23.895 --> 18:26.425
And Reiji Ozora...

18:27.635 --> 18:29.125
I'm looking forward to it.

18:30.305 --> 18:31.495
Take this, Reiji!

18:33.545 --> 18:35.235
Roar, Gholaoh!

18:46.825 --> 18:48.015
Yeah!

18:49.325 --> 18:51.885
Well, the training stage is also a lot of fun.

18:52.295 --> 18:54.955
But you sure did get a lot stronger, Reiji.

18:55.195 --> 18:57.995
Even when I team up
with Daisuke, it's no match.

18:57.995 --> 18:58.985
I guess.

18:59.365 --> 19:02.205
But we could handle it
if we trained here as well.

19:03.575 --> 19:05.845
What's the matter?

19:05.845 --> 19:07.875
Do you hear something?

19:07.875 --> 19:09.175
A sound like a song?

19:09.175 --> 19:10.275
Sound?

19:10.275 --> 19:12.675
- Not at all. Right?
- Yeah.

19:13.015 --> 19:14.415
Really?

19:14.415 --> 19:16.115
I swear I've heard it before.

19:16.115 --> 19:19.485
Maybe there's something the matter
with your program, Reiji.

19:21.825 --> 19:24.625
Hey, how about we call it a day?

19:24.855 --> 19:27.665
What are you talking about?
We're just beginning here!

19:27.665 --> 19:28.785
Right, Daisuke?

19:29.135 --> 19:31.565
Yeah. I want to get stronger, too.

19:32.135 --> 19:33.735
That's not it.

19:33.735 --> 19:37.565
It's just that I've been getting
this creepy feeling for the last while.

19:38.135 --> 19:39.805
Creepy feeling?

19:40.305 --> 19:43.615
Like what?

19:43.615 --> 19:44.875
What's the matter all of a sudden?!

19:45.885 --> 19:46.975
What's this wind?

19:51.215 --> 19:52.345
This sound.

19:52.585 --> 19:54.255
I heard it in my dream.

19:54.255 --> 19:56.125
What is that? Something's coming!

19:56.425 --> 19:57.415
What?

20:02.195 --> 20:03.185
What is that?

20:04.235 --> 20:05.255
I don't know.

20:07.635 --> 20:09.605
Eww... What is this?!

20:09.875 --> 20:11.995
Wh-What's going on?

20:12.375 --> 20:14.845
M-My body's!

20:14.845 --> 20:15.775
No.

20:16.145 --> 20:19.275
This isn't at all like going back
to reality from the D-Z one.

20:19.785 --> 20:21.005
I can hear it!

20:21.445 --> 20:22.675
This is it!

20:25.455 --> 20:27.355
This time I can hear it clearly.

20:44.135 --> 20:45.465
A d-dragon?!

20:56.155 --> 20:57.275
She's calling me.

20:59.425 --> 21:00.215
Reiji!

21:17.005 --> 21:18.235
Did you see that?

21:18.235 --> 21:19.225
Yes.

21:19.475 --> 21:21.345
Reiji and his friends...

21:21.345 --> 21:22.575
Vanished.

21:31.855 --> 21:33.855
Ow, ow, ow...

21:33.855 --> 21:35.015
What in the world?

21:35.595 --> 21:37.925
What's going on here?

21:56.575 --> 21:59.315
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.315 --> 22:02.085
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.085 --> 22:06.045
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.485 --> 22:10.255
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.255 --> 22:12.455
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.895 --> 22:17.025
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.435 --> 22:21.105
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.105 --> 22:23.835
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.835 --> 22:27.835
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.145 --> 22:31.645
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.645 --> 22:34.645
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.645 --> 22:39.555
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.185 --> 22:42.925
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.925 --> 22:45.695
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.695 --> 22:50.355
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.065 --> 22:53.835
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.835 --> 22:56.505
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.505 --> 23:01.165
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.805 --> 23:06.335
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.245 --> 23:12.945
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.285 --> 23:17.925
Next Episode

23:17.925 --> 23:20.395
What's going on?
Where on earth is this place?

23:21.325 --> 23:23.125
Huh? It's Rikyu?

23:23.265 --> 23:24.165
What's that?

23:24.165 --> 23:25.565
And who's that old lady?

23:25.565 --> 23:28.595
She's wearing some weird clothes,
and she looks kinda scary.

23:30.935 --> 23:34.045
Oh yeah, and she goes on about
Senkohcoola and RI-ON...

23:34.045 --> 23:35.375
...and something about "the Dragonite".

23:35.375 --> 23:37.275
I don't understand what she's talking about!

23:37.715 --> 23:40.305
Next time on Dragon Drive,
"Successor".

23:41.815 --> 23:42.385
Honestly, you're the one
I understand least of all.

23:42.385 --> 23:44.975
Successor
Honestly, you're the one
I understand least of all.
